Notebook[{
Cell["Matrix units and irreducible blocks of A^d_{p,q} (Appendix D). Reads the Sage primitive idempotents wba_idempotents_db/primitive_p_q[_d].txt and writes idempotents/primitive_p_q_d.m and metadata_p_q_d.m ({irrep dimensions, Bratteli paths, WalledBrauerBasis[p,q]}), idempotents/elementary_p_q_d.m (matrix units E[[lambda,i,j]] as coefficient vectors over WalledBrauerBasis[p,q]) and blocks/blocks_p_q_d.m (the irreducible blocks of every basis diagram). The two Do loops below are set to the (p,q,d) of the last run; change their ranges to regenerate other files. Existing elementary files are re-used, not recomputed (see eps); delete them first to force a recomputation.", "Text"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{"Clear", "[", "s", "]"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"s", "[", 
    RowBox[{"p_", ",", "q_", ",", "d_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"s", "[", 
     RowBox[{"p", ",", "q", ",", "d"}], "]"}], "=", 
    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"d", ">=", 
       RowBox[{"p", "+", "q"}]}], ",", 
      RowBox[{"Import", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], "<>", 
        "\"\<wba_idempotents_db/primitive_\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<_\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "q", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<.txt\>\""}], "]"}], 
      ",", 
      RowBox[{"Import", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NotebookDirectory", "[", "]"}], "<>", 
        "\"\<wba_idempotents_db/primitive_\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "p", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<_\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "q", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<_\>\"", "<>", 
        RowBox[{"ToString", "[", "d", "]"}], "<>", "\"\<.txt\>\""}], "]"}]}], 
     "]"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 InitializationCell->True,
